# The operator, 2026-10-11 (Scapeshift into Valakut, the Molten Pinnacle): every simultaneous trigger
# drawn as a chip before the first target question, one target for all of them, no "Do you want to
# deal 3 damage" after the target was chosen, the chips scattered round their source.
# Alice holds her main phase with Splendid Reclamation and four Forests; six Mountains wait in her
# graveyard. The Reclamation returns all six at once: each sees five others, so Valakut triggers six
# times, all at once, each asking for a target. Bob has nothing to do; 6 × 3 leaves him at 2.
